	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1">Das Jahr ergibt sich aus dem Bezug auf die <placeName ref="l41" cert="high">Berner</placeName> Sondersynode vom September 1537 (vgl. oben <ref target="file11088">Nr. 1045</ref>); zum Tagesdatum s. unten Anm. g.</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salve in Christo domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quę <placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> his diebus essent acta, scribe<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>re me ad vos <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> hinc abiens iussit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Equidem cum et ipse multis scripserit<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> Brief vom 2. Oktober (s. unten <ref target="file11098">Nr. 1055</ref>, 2-4) ist nicht erhalten.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et exemplar actorum ad vos mittatur<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Siehe unten <ref target="file11095">Nr. 1052</ref>, 8-10 mit Anm. 7.</note> et fama iamdudum ad vos pleraque <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>omnia veniant, supervacuum, arbitror, est scribere multa.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Solum hoc dicam, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quod saepe apud te memini conqueri: Miserabile videtur, si per nos <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>posteris nostris confirmatum schisma transmittatur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quod fieri necesse <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>erit, si coire coepta concordia hoc tempore non potest, quo boni <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>viri omnes, ut coiret, operam impenderunt idque tot annis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Fac enim <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>dissilire nunc et fieri nil posse - quis, obsecro, rem hanc deinde tentabit, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quae videbitur omnibus modis impossibilis?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Itaque ecclesia patriaque <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>nostra vixdum ad lucem divini verbi paululum suspiciens nebulam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>hanc miserandę discordiae ob oculos positam semper habebit et puro <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>coelo solem hunc doctrinae Christi cernere nunquam poterit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ac in <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>vultu germanę ecclesiae naevus hic in oculis omnium gentium erit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Ergo stat regnum papę immotum per civile bellum nostrum, ecclesia <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>vera nostra stare (o diram rem) diutius non potest.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Testor d. Christum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>dominum acerbiorem cogitacionem incidere nullam posse, praeserti<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>m cum videam nudis iam suspitionibus dividi et artibus sathanę <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>meris neminem animis Christo dignis rem tantam cogitare velle.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Haec cum animo volvo videoque, libenter me, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> charissime, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ei negotio impendo nec usquam pedem unum promoveo<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. <persName ref="p19923">Phaedrus</persName>, 4, 26, 28.</note>, quin domin<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>um orem, ut nos copulare in veritate velit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Equidem si confieri <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>iam concordia non potest, quae mihi videtur proxime coivisse, solum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>hoc demus operam,<pb type="edition" next="259"/> ut ne dissiliat praecipiti quorundam hominum studio.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Nobis nullo pacto video, quid sit metuendum, qui in eam descendimus <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>iis conditionibus, quae sunt ab omni parte tutissimę et veritate <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>munitissimae.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Mirum est<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>nach</hi> est <hi>gestrichenes</hi> Bernae.</note>, quam frigide confessio<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Gemeint ist das Erste <placeName ref="l862">Helvetische</placeName> Bekenntnis bzw. dessen Auslegung im Brief der reformierten Städte der <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossenschaft</placeName> an <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> vom 12. Januar (vgl. oben <ref target="file10976">Nr. 934</ref>, Anm. 15).</note> nostra<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>nach</hi> nostra <hi>nachgetragenes und wieder gestrichenes</hi> confessio.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>in qua concordiae conditiones nobis positę sunt, <placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> tractata <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>sit a quibusdam, quorum tu ingenium bene nosti<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p1365">Grynäus</persName> denkt wohl an <persName ref="p8412">Megander</persName>, der kritisiert hatte, die Annäherung an <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> sei allzu rasch erfolgt; s. <bibl source="b319">Hundeshagen</bibl> 86.</note>, ac parum abfuit, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>quin haec ecclesia sola prorsus nobis a concordia alienaretur.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb type="scan" next="||252v."/><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Quid istud rei est, obsecro, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> charissime: Quod semel placuit quodque <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>placet, displicere video, quia coniungere nos cum eo videtur, unde <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>nobis animus abhorret.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Aut quomodo viris christianis gravis esse pax <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>cum christiano intercedens potest, aut quales servi Christi erimus <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>aeternam discordiam inter nos ipsos alentes?</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Verum, ut solet, superior <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>est dominus et vincit, studiaque bonorum superabunt tandem, arbitror.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Valde nos tua humanitas in hoc toto hactenus negotio iuvit.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Itaque pergamus invito sathana concordiam eam ecclesię constabilire.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Quae cum veritate nixa sit, eadem et ecclesiam nostram adversus <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>omnem incursum hostium munire<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>vor</hi> munire <hi>gestrichenes</hi> papam.</note>, papam cum omni suorum conspiratione <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>deiicere possit.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Dominus Christus faxit, ut vigilantissimis <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>animis in rem tantam tractandam incumbamus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">De praesentia corporis <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>domini in coelesti gloria manentis positique et se nullo pacto <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>ad haec nostra corruptibilia demittentis et eius per fidem vivifi<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>ca<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e">vivifica <hi>vom Schreiber korrigiert aus</hi> vivificam.</note> manducatione, item de accubitu fideli<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f">fideli <hi>vom Schreiber korrigiert aus</hi> fidelis.</note> sed, indigno, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>de impiorum etiam esu inutili ac pernitioso ipsis sic audivi <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>in hoc toto itinere loquentem <persName ref="p467">Bucerum</persName>, ut teipsum de rebus iis <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>locuturum esse aliter minime credam aut verbo uno variaturum.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Rogabo dominum, ut bonos omnes et abs se sanctificatos animis inter se <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>conciliare prorsus velit.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Rogo te, ut illud cor pium et candidum <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>ne desinas rei summae, concordiae ecclesiae scilicet, impendere.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/>Idem rogo vos omnes, <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandrum</persName> nostrum inprimis, singulare <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>ecclesiae ornamentum et instrumentum.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Dominus Christus Iesus, in quo <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>vincimus quique ipse praesens in nobis vivit ac nos discipul<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>os optimus magister omni momento praesenti vivoque afflatu spiritus <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>sui docet ac dirigit, conciliet nos in ipso vere.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z27"/>3.<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g"><hi>Die Lesung der Ziffer bleibt unsicher (3 scheint aus 2 korrigiert zu sein).</hi></note> octobris, <placeName ref="l28">Basilęae</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p1365">S. <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>Gryneus</persName> tuus <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>frater in domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf f. 253v.:]</note>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Praestanti viro domino <lb xml:id="p4z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heylricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>charissimo in Christo fratri.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tyguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
